    """Create an implicit plane with infinite extents.

    Args:
        normal (Real3Like): Normal vector of the plane, in the shape's local frame.
            Need not be unit length; it is normalized internally.
        distance (float): Signed offset [m] from the origin to the plane, measured
            along the (normalized) ``normal``. The plane equation is
            dot(normalize(normal), x) = distance.

    Returns:
        A :class:`~superdex.physics.ShapeHandle` that can be used to create rigid
        actors.

    Raises:
        :class:`~superdex.physics.Error`: If an error occurs.

    Note:
