    ) -> None:
        """Find the actor's nodes that are inside an axis-aligned bounding box (AABB).

        Args:
            volume (Aabb): Axis-aligned bounding box in the actor's local frame.
            boundary_only (bool): If true, only boundary nodes are considered.
            callback (Callable[[int, Real3], None]): Callback called for each node
                found. The position is the current node position [m] in the actor's
                local frame. The node index uses
                :meth:`~superdex.physics.Actor.get_mesh` ordering, including when
